WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
[Simulated gaze, no camera] The pointer moves to "Start in simulator" and the ring fills. A confirm card stops the call.

00:05.000 --> 00:09.000
Gaze rests on Cancel. The card closes and nothing happens.

00:09.000 --> 00:18.000
Again. This time gaze holds on Confirm for twice the usual time, and the simulator call starts.

00:18.000 --> 00:27.000
Gaze rests on "Calls" in the menu. A plain link opens with no card.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.000
"Stop" turns hands-free off. There is no sound in this recording.
